# Build context is tests/ (Harbor verifier context_dir, symmetric with the agent
# image's environment/ context). The verifier Dockerfile does `COPY . /tests/`, so
# ship the whole verifier tree — test.sh, reward.toml, test_output.py and judge/ —
# and drop only caches and scratch.
#
# The previous `*` + `!tests/` + `!tests/**` excluded EVERYTHING relative to this
# context: there is no tests/tests/ subdir to re-include, so the verifier image
# would have shipped empty. Never surfaced because no verifier build has run yet.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
**/.DS_Store
